OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for woodland the size of 800
OL,4,Afootball pitches
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe South Downs National Park plans to
OL,7,Fcreate woodland the size of 800
OL,8,Ffootball pitches across Sussex and
OL,9,FHampshire.
OL,11,FThe project will see landowners being
OL,12,Fencouraged to propose sites for mass
OL,13,Ftree which will create 500 hectares of
OL,14,Fnew woodland in the next six years.
OL,16,FNick Heasman, head of natural capital
OL,17,Fat the South Downs National Park
OL,18,FAuthority, said woodlands were "vital"
OL,19,Fnational infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
